          "type": "faq",
          "id": "mp-faq",
          "items": [
            {
              "q": "Can you copy a Google map?",
              "a": "I can look. I will not applique their labels. The quilt is a drawing, not a screenshot."
            },
            {
              "q": "Do you do fictional places?",
              "a": "Yes, if you can describe them. Invented towns still need a legend."
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "bg": "none",
            "width": "narrow"
